sequenceDiagram
    participant AC as AuctionCloser
    participant ADB as Auctions tables
    participant AOP as Auctions OutboxProcessor
    participant WH as Wallets - AuctionFinishedEventHandler
    participant WDB as Wallets tables
    participant WOP as Wallets OutboxProcessor
    participant IH as Inventory - AuctionFinishedEventHandler / AuctionSettledEventHandler
    participant IDB as Inventory tables

    loop every 3 s
        AC->>ADB: Auctions with Status = Active and EndsOn in the past, max 20
    end
    AC->>ADB: Auction.CloseAuction + OutboxMessages(AuctionFinishedEvent) per auction, one SaveChangesAsync per batch
    AOP->>WH: Publish(AuctionFinishedEvent) - the Wallets handler runs first
    alt WinnerUserId present
        WH->>WDB: WasEventProcessedAsync(EventId)
        WH->>WH: winner.SpendLockedFunds(FinalPrice), seller.AddFunds(FinalPrice)
        WH->>WDB: UPDATE Wallets x2 + WalletsProcessedMessages + WalletsOutboxMessages(AuctionSettledEvent)
    else no winner
        WH-->>AOP: return without changes
    end
    AOP->>IH: the same event - the Inventory handler runs second
    alt no winner
        IH->>IDB: GetItemLockedForAuctionAsync, Item.UnlockItem + InventoryProcessedMessages
    else WinnerUserId present
        IH-->>AOP: return without changes
    end
    WOP->>IH: Publish(AuctionSettledEvent) on the next Wallets poll
    IH->>IDB: GetItemLockedForAuctionAsync, Item.TransferTo(WinnerUserId) + InventoryProcessedMessages
    Note over WH,IH: the item moves only after the money moved
